IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ccc-core`

-- ccc13-tests-support.l4 -- fixtures and readers shared by the ccc13 test files. It holds no rule of the Code.
-- Every name begins with `ccc13 test` so that it cannot collide with a name in the merged folder.

-- The s 787(1) answer is another part's (ccc29). These are STAND-IN figures chosen to be unlike any real figure, so that
-- a test that passes shows the input is passed through unchanged; they claim nothing about section 787(1).
`ccc13 test the stand-in for the s 787(1) general penalty` MEANS
    Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 7, 0, FALSE), `no imprisonment is stated`, `a fine of` 1234, `no fine is stated`

`ccc13 test p787` MEANS `ccc13 test the stand-in for the s 787(1) general penalty`

GIVEN answer IS A MAYBE (LIST OF Punishment)
GIVETH A LIST OF Punishment
`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` MEANS
    CONSIDER answer
    WHEN NOTHING THEN EMPTY
    WHEN JUST limbs THEN limbs

GIVEN mode IS A `Mode of proceeding`, limbs IS A LIST OF Punishment
GIVETH A MAYBE Punishment
`ccc13 test the first limb with the mode` MEANS
    CONSIDER limbs
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN limb FOLLOWED BY rest THEN IF limb's `mode` EQUALS mode THEN JUST limb ELSE `ccc13 test the first limb with the mode` mode rest

GIVEN limbs IS A LIST OF Punishment
GIVETH A NUMBER
`ccc13 test the number of limbs` MEANS count limbs

GIVEN limbs IS A LIST OF Punishment
GIVETH A Imprisonment
`ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment by indictment` MEANS
    CONSIDER `ccc13 test the first limb with the mode` `by indictment` limbs
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `no imprisonment is stated`
    WHEN JUST limb THEN limb's `maximum imprisonment`

GIVEN limbs IS A LIST OF Punishment
GIVETH A Imprisonment
`ccc13 test the minimum imprisonment by indictment` MEANS
    CONSIDER `ccc13 test the first limb with the mode` `by indictment` limbs
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `no imprisonment is stated`
    WHEN JUST limb THEN limb's `minimum imprisonment`

GIVEN limbs IS A LIST OF Punishment
GIVETH A Fine
`ccc13 test the maximum fine by indictment` MEANS
    CONSIDER `ccc13 test the first limb with the mode` `by indictment` limbs
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `no fine is stated`
    WHEN JUST limb THEN limb's `maximum fine`

GIVEN limbs IS A LIST OF Punishment
GIVETH A Imprisonment
`ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment on summary conviction` MEANS
    CONSIDER `ccc13 test the first limb with the mode` `on summary conviction` limbs
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `no imprisonment is stated`
    WHEN JUST limb THEN limb's `maximum imprisonment`

GIVEN limbs IS A LIST OF Punishment
GIVETH A Imprisonment
`ccc13 test the minimum imprisonment on summary conviction` MEANS
    CONSIDER `ccc13 test the first limb with the mode` `on summary conviction` limbs
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `no imprisonment is stated`
    WHEN JUST limb THEN limb's `minimum imprisonment`

GIVEN limbs IS A LIST OF Punishment
GIVETH A Fine
`ccc13 test the maximum fine on summary conviction` MEANS
    CONSIDER `ccc13 test the first limb with the mode` `on summary conviction` limbs
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `no fine is stated`
    WHEN JUST limb THEN limb's `maximum fine`

GIVEN limbs IS A LIST OF Punishment
GIVETH A Fine
`ccc13 test the minimum fine on summary conviction` MEANS
    CONSIDER `ccc13 test the first limb with the mode` `on summary conviction` limbs
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `no fine is stated`
    WHEN JUST limb THEN limb's `minimum fine`

GIVEN limbs IS A LIST OF Punishment
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ccc13 test the summary limb is the s 787(1) stand-in` MEANS
    `ccc13 test the first limb with the mode` `on summary conviction` limbs EQUALS JUST `ccc13 test the stand-in for the s 787(1) general penalty`

-- A Provision of the Code, written short: section and subsection.
GIVEN s IS A NUMBER, sub IS A STRING
GIVETH A `Provision of the Code`
`ccc13 test the provision` MEANS `Provision of the Code` OF s, sub
